      "description": "Quality-sorted decile portfolio returns and factor alphas, US Long Sample 7/1957-12/2016",
      "replication_meaning": "Demonstrates that the composite quality score (Profitability + Growth + Safety, each from multiple sub-variables via rank z-scores) is correctly constructed from Compustat annual/quarterly fundamentals and CRSP daily/monthly data, that decile-sort portfolio construction with NYSE breakpoints and value-weighting is correctly implemented, and that the 4-factor alpha regression is correctly specified. A match on the H-L excess return (0.42%) and H-L 4-factor alpha (1.05%) validates the entire signal pipeline end-to-end.",
